			"notes": "hey look an actual custom living entity (and a clone of a vanilla one)\n\n### Additions\n* Ore generation config options (#24)\n* Extended color sheep. Same as regular sheep, but it uses the mod's dyes.\n* Snow Eye mob. One spawns in every snow dungeon\n* Another snow dungeon challenge room (just a modified version of an old design)\n* Snow dungeon achievements\n* Spell stats\n* Error checking and logging for ore drops to help figure out the cause of #22\n\n### Changes\n* World gen code refactor. Structures and chasms generate before biome decorations now\n\t* Maybe this fixes #12?\n* Chasms check for biomes to spawn covered in differently\n* Shiny rocks can now only be obtained from gravel in the overworld (by default)\n* Made recipe for compacted snow more expensive\n\n### Fixes\n* Netherite scythe and halberd cannot be crafted (#6)\n* Duplicate tool crafting recipes (#10)\n* Netherite and NTM-material halberds render as iron halberds when thrown\n* Vines incorrectly rotated correctly in structures\n* Outdated /flightspeed tab completion suggestions\n* Minor coloring bug in spell selection menu\n* Mana and magic skill levels can be pushed beyond maximum if the game is lagging\n* Ore name errors"
		},
