			"notes": "it's been a while since the last release because I was busy with other stuff and then got distracted with rewriting all of the structure code\n\n### Additions\n* Config option to change the dimension chasms spawn in (#23)\n* New house structure\n* Swap spell\n* Hop spell\n* Halt spell\n* JVM argument \"-Dresadditae.testing=true\"; enables all debug features\n\n### Changes\n* Structure code has been completely rewritten\n* Snow dungeons now spawn half as many underground rooms, and the connecting hallways are different\n* Bullet time spell uses less mana\n\n### Fixes\n* Snow dungeon spawns at correct height (#19)\n* Depths portals no longer destroyed by explosions (#21)\n\n### Removals\n* Old house structure\n\n### Known issues\n* Certain blocks are not rotated correctly in structures\n* World gen performance issues\n\nI'm releasing this with the above issues as I just want to put a new build out, even if unfinished"
